{"id":"n67833-1-11","stage":5,"title":"열량 · 热量","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67833-1-11-1","ko":"이거 먹을래? 엄청 달고 맛있어.","zh":"想吃这个吗？特别甜，味道也很棒。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이거","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}},{"text":"먹을래?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹을래","audio":"/audio/e26481134d8401e0f05f.mp3"}},{"text":"엄청","meaning":"相当，特别","explanation":"엄청：相当，特别","readings":[{"term":"엄청","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67346","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄청","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄청","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3"}},{"text":"달고","meaning":"甜，甘甜","explanation":"달다：甜，甘甜；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"달다","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62741","senseId":"1","lemma":"달다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달고","audio":"/audio/08753770f5e052097e5c.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있어.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있어","audio":"/audio/c4fb6c8354fef764546b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"31ff8e60cae7be0a","term":"엄청","zh":"相当，特别","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3","entryId":"67346","definition":"量或程度十分过分地。","pronunciation":["엄청"]},{"id":"bb552fc456991067","term":"달다","zh":"甜，甘甜","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3","entryId":"62741","definition":"与蜂蜜或糖的味道相似。","pronunciation":["달다"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ed43066266daa7ad6783.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67833-1-11-2","ko":"열량이 높은 거라 안 먹을래. 나 지금 다이어트 중이거든.","zh":"因为热量很高，所以不想吃。我现在正在减肥呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"열량이","meaning":"热量","explanation":"열량：热量；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"열량","audio":"/audio/f9b66fd4f3a9eb690d36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67833","senseId":"1","lemma":"열량","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열량이","audio":"/audio/188110b9b3cfcb8d2a31.mp3"}},{"text":"높은","meaning":"高，大","explanation":"높다：高，大；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"높다","audio":"/audio/5601621a4a648d5bc309.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64523","senseId":"3","lemma":"높다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"높은","audio":"/audio/547757ca987cef7f5b40.mp3"}},{"text":"거라","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거라","audio":"/audio/3dba2bc87596c1512b18.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"먹을래.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹을래","audio":"/audio/e26481134d8401e0f05f.mp3"}},{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"다이어트","meaning":"节食，减肥","explanation":"다이어트：节食，减肥","readings":[{"term":"다이어트","audio":"/audio/5998c9b179df5fd3b4c0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28352","senseId":"1","lemma":"다이어트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다이어트","audio":"/audio/5998c9b179df5fd3b4c0.mp3"}},{"text":"중이거든.","meaning":"处在某状态的期间。","explanation":"중：处在某状态的期间。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"3","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중이거든","audio":"/audio/561ccf8a87c5f9d74105.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f9b66fd4f3a9eb69","term":"열량","zh":"热量","audio":"/audio/f9b66fd4f3a9eb690d36.mp3","entryId":"67833","definition":"通过食物或燃料等能够获得的能源的量。","pronunciation":["열량"]},{"id":"5601621a4a648d5b","term":"높다","zh":"高，大","audio":"/audio/5601621a4a648d5bc309.mp3","entryId":"64523","definition":"温度、湿度、压力等在规定的基准之上。","pronunciation":["놉따"]},{"id":"ffce